  << /ActualText (Satellite Change Detector                                                                                                         ML Computer Vision Project\nBuilt a Siamese U\055Net from scratch to detect surface changes between satellite image pairs\054 achieving 0\05670 IoU and 0\05679 F1 on the LEVIR\055CD benchmark\nTrained on a combined dataset of 1\054083 high\055resolution Google Earth image pairs \050LEVIR\055CD \053 LEVIR\055CD\053\051 using PyTorch with ResNet\05534 encoder and BCE \053 Dice loss\nDeployed as a live interactive web app on Hugging Face Spaces with real\055time heatmap overlay\054 binary change mask\054 and per\055pixel probability visualization\nImplemented Test Time Augmentation \050TTA\051 at inference to improve prediction robustness without additional training)
     /K [ 12 ]
